WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.400
For generations, six great wards have kept the kingdom safe.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:11.000
Their runes guide the rivers, guard the harvest, and hold the night beyond the door.

3
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.000
Last night, something broke them.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:22.200
Now strange creatures walk the roads, and a voice from the distant palace calls itself the Hollow King.

5
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.700
At your village gate, you find an old sword buried beneath a fallen rune-stone.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.200
As you lift it, a question shines along the blade. You speak the answer.

7
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.200
The sword lights up. Beyond the fence, something stirs.

8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.600
Your journey begins at home.
